      "value": "We are working on a replacement. \nVery few creators use VRC_Panorama in VRCSDK2 for… well, panoramas. Instead, most people use it to get a remote image from the internet. We're formalizing this by creating a \"dynamic image\" component that lets you grab images from the web. This is on the way.",
