  "details": "The Panorama script is used in numerous worlds to load external images such as event calendars, etc that are updated frequently without having to re-publish a world (a real boon to those with slow connections, in particular). It's been gone in SDK3 since it was introduced, and I'm sure myself and many others would really like to see it or a suitable replacement for it return.",
